WEBVTT

00:31:29.558 --> 00:31:32.316
try to form a high-quality
connection in one minute.

00:31:32.340 --> 00:31:35.256
If you were in their shoes,
what would you say?

00:31:35.280 --> 00:31:38.658
How would you go about
building an instant connection?

00:31:38.682 --> 00:31:40.446
Here's how one pair approached it.

00:31:40.470 --> 00:31:42.476
Jessica: Jessica Hester, I'm a journalist.

00:31:42.500 --> 00:31:44.726
Bess: I'm Bess Carey, I'm an HR manager.

00:31:44.750 --> 00:31:46.908
AG: Jessica and Bess
work for the same company

00:31:46.932 --> 00:31:48.512
but they barely know each other.

00:31:48.536 --> 00:31:51.032
Jessica: Alright, I am excited
or interested to know

00:31:51.056 --> 00:31:53.085
what the last thing
you read or watched was

00:31:53.109 --> 00:31:55.011
that gave you, like, a ton of joy.

00:31:55.451 --> 00:32:01.337
Bess: Ummm ... I have no ...
I have no idea.